  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 1501.01 Purpose and Scope. This part contains the procedures and requirements for the submission of health care facility discharge data from health care facilities licensed in accordance with RSA 151:2, I(a) and (d) pursuant to RSA 126:25 and 27.\n\nSource. #4069, eff 6-6-86; ss by #4542, eff 12-12-88; ss by #5844, eff 7-1-94, EXPIRED: 7-1-00\n\nNew. # 9436, eff 3-21-09, EXPIRED: 3-21-17\n\nNew. #12139, INTERIM, eff 3-22-17, EXPIRED: 9-18-17\n\nNew. #13369, eff 4-20-22",
